{"out": "../../../output/nice-ignored-draft/part7.mp4", "audio": "p7.wav", "speed": 1.0, "tail": 2.0, "music_fade": 2.0, "music_cues": [{"shot": 0, "music": "../../../../reels/audio/music/fifth-of-february.mp3", "start": 20.0}, {"shot": 12, "music": "../../../../reels/audio/music/unforgiven.mp3", "start": 90.0}, {"shot": 20, "music": "../../../../reels/audio/music/fifth-of-february.mp3"}], "music_volume": 0.33, "fade_out": 2.0, "style": {"grade": "film", "captions": "karaoke", "caption_y": 0.86, "vignette": 0.36, "grain": 6}, "shots": [{"text": "Here's what happened when I started living like this.", "v": {"video": "../../stock/confident-walk-6.mp4", "start": 2.0, "zoom": 1.08}}, {"text": "I lost a few people.", "v": {"mg": "kinetic", "lines": [["I LOST", "white"], ["A FEW PEOPLE.", "white"]], "times": [0.0, "@few"]}, "in": "wipe", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}], "captions": false}, {"text": "The ones who only liked me because I was useful drifted away.", "v": {"video": "../../stock/crowd-party-5.mp4", "start": 2.0, "zoom": 1.08}, "in": "flash", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh-fast", "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "And honestly, that hurt.", "v": {"img": "../../img/n-car-night.jpg", "focus": [0.5, 0.4], "zoom": 1.4}, "in": "wipe", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "But the people who stayed started treating me differently.", "v": {"video": "../../stock/friends-pizza-0.mp4", "start": 2.0, "zoom": 1.08}, "in": "cut"}, {"text": "They asked my opinion. They invited me first.", "v": {"img": "../../img/n-pizza.jpg", "focus": [0.5, 0.45], "zoom": 1.1}, "in": "wipe", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "They respected my time, because I finally respected it.", "v": {"mg": "gauge", "title": "AFTER", "bars": [["LIKED", 80, "yellow"], ["RESPECTED", 85, "yellow"]]}, "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}, {"name": "sparkle", "at": "@finally"}], "in": "wipe", "captions": false}, {"text": "And years later, I ran into Chloe at a friend's wedding.", "v": {"video": "../../stock/wedding-1.mp4", "start": 2.0, "zoom": 1.08}, "in": "wipe", "pause_before": 0.3, "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "We talked for a while, and at one point she laughed and said,", "v": {"img": "../../img/n-wedding.jpg", "focus": [0.55, 0.45], "zoom": 1.0, "to_zoom": 1.3, "drift": 0}, "in": "wipe", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "\"You're so different now. You actually tell me when I'm wrong.\"", "v": {"mg": "quote", "text": "\"You're so different now. You actually tell me when I'm wrong.\"", "end": "@wrong", "width": 30}, "in": "wipe", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}], "captions": false}, {"text": "She meant it as a compliment.", "v": {"img": "../../img/n-wedding.jpg", "focus": [0.7, 0.35], "zoom": 1.6}, "in": "flash", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh-fast", "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "And for the first time, I realised I didn't need it to be.", "v": {"img": "../../img/n-wedding.jpg", "focus": [0.45, 0.35], "zoom": 1.6}, "in": "cut"}, {"text": "So if you're a nice person who keeps getting ignored, I don't want you to stop being good.", "v": {"video": "../../stock/confident-walk-1.mp4", "start": 6.0, "zoom": 1.08}, "pause_before": 0.25, "in": "cut"}, {"text": "The world needs good people.", "v": {"mg": "kinetic", "lines": [["THE WORLD NEEDS", "white"], ["GOOD PEOPLE.", "yellow"]], "times": [0.0, "@good"]}, "in": "wipe", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}], "captions": false}, {"text": "I want you to stop being nice and start being kind.", "v": {"mg": "versus", "left": ["STOP BEING", "NICE"], "right": ["START BEING", "KIND"], "at": "@kind", "left_at": 0.0}, "sfx": [{"name": "reveal", "at": "@kind"}], "in": "cut", "captions": false}, {"text": "Have opinions.", "v": {"mg": "checklist", "title": "BE KIND, NOT NICE", "items": ["HAVE OPINIONS", "SAY NO", "STOP APOLOGISING", "LET PEOPLE BE DISAPPOINTED", "GIVE BECAUSE YOU WANT TO"], "times": [0.05, 999, 999, 999, 999]}, "sfx": [{"name": "pop", "at": 0.05}], "in": "cut", "captions": false}, {"text": "Say no.", "v": {"mg": "checklist", "title": "BE KIND, NOT NICE", "items": ["HAVE OPINIONS", "SAY NO", "STOP APOLOGISING", "LET PEOPLE BE DISAPPOINTED", "GIVE BECAUSE YOU WANT TO"], "times": [-1, 0.05, 999, 999, 999]}, "in": "cut", "sfx": [{"name": "pop", "at": 0.05}], "captions": false}, {"text": "Stop apologising.", "v": {"mg": "checklist", "title": "BE KIND, NOT NICE", "items": ["HAVE OPINIONS", "SAY NO", "STOP APOLOGISING", "LET PEOPLE BE DISAPPOINTED", "GIVE BECAUSE YOU WANT TO"], "times": [-1, -1, 0.05, 999, 999]}, "in": "cut", "sfx": [{"name": "pop", "at": 0.05}], "captions": false}, {"text": "Let people be disappointed.", "v": {"mg": "checklist", "title": "BE KIND, NOT NICE", "items": ["HAVE OPINIONS", "SAY NO", "STOP APOLOGISING", "LET PEOPLE BE DISAPPOINTED", "GIVE BECAUSE YOU WANT TO"], "times": [-1, -1, -1, 0.05, 999]}, "in": "cut", "sfx": [{"name": "pop", "at": 0.05}], "captions": false}, {"text": "And give because you want to, not because you need something back.", "v": {"mg": "checklist", "title": "BE KIND, NOT NICE", "items": ["HAVE OPINIONS", "SAY NO", "STOP APOLOGISING", "LET PEOPLE BE DISAPPOINTED", "GIVE BECAUSE YOU WANT TO"], "times": [-1, -1, -1, -1, 0.05]}, "in": "cut", "sfx": [{"name": "sparkle", "at": 0.05}], "captions": false}, {"text": "You don't have to be less good. You just have to be more you.", "v": {"mg": "marker", "lines": ["NOT LESS GOOD.", "MORE YOU."], "mark": ["MORE YOU."], "times": [0.0, "@more"]}, "pause_before": 0.25, "in": "cut", "captions": false}, {"text": "The version of you with opinions, with limits, with a life of your own.", "v": {"img": "../../img/n-spine.jpg", "focus": [0.5, 0.5], "zoom": 1.0, "drift": 0.07}, "in": "flash", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh-fast", "gain": 0.5}]}, {"text": "That person isn't less lovable.", "v": {"img": "../../img/n-seen.jpg", "focus": [0.5, 0.45], "zoom": 1.0, "to_zoom": 1.3, "drift": 0}, "in": "cut"}, {"text": "That person is finally someone people can actually see.", "v": {"img": "../../img/n-seen.jpg", "focus": [0.48, 0.35], "zoom": 1.5}, "sfx": [{"name": "sparkle", "at": "@see"}], "in": "cut"}, {"text": "If this hit home, send it to the nicest person you know.", "v": {"mg": "kinetic", "lines": [["SEND THIS TO", "white"], ["THE NICEST PERSON", "yellow"], ["YOU KNOW", "white"]], "times": ["@send", "@nicest", "@know"]}, "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh", "gain": 0.5}, {"name": "pop", "at": "@send"}, {"name": "pop", "at": "@nicest"}], "in": "wipe", "captions": false}, {"text": "They probably need to hear it more than anyone. And I'll see you in the next one.", "v": {"video": "../../stock/confident-walk-6.mp4", "start": 6.0, "zoom": 1.08}, "in": "flash", "sfx": [{"name": "swoosh-fast", "gain": 0.5}]}]}